      "places": [
        "GET /index.php/apps/rotatingwallpapers/  rotatingwallpapers.page.index  lib/Controller/PageController.php:22"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Nothing in the app calls 1 route outside OCS. Looked for: a route name or a path in the PHP source and the templates, in 7 files of the frontend source and in the navigation of info.xml. A route stays behind when the frontend stops calling it. A route that only a client outside the app calls shows here as well, unless its method allows requests from other origins (CORS).",
        "  GET /index.php/apps/rotatingwallpapers/  rotatingwallpapers.page.index  lib/Controller/PageController.php:22"
      ]
    },
